    Project Open Data data.json with "distribution" arrays; one dataset carries a licence URI
    (https://open.fda.gov/license) and "accrualPeriodicity": "R/P1Y". TRUNCATED: the catalog envelope plus the first 20
    entries of "dataset" (the full file is ~31 MB, 31,319,575 bytes), cut by parsing the first 1.2 MB of the stream; the 20
    entries are verbatim. Written without indentation.
    The owner's "HHS" address https://www.hhs.gov/data.json answered HTTP 403 "Access Denied" (an Akamai block) to
    this client, to curl's default agent and over http; it was not retried with another identity. healthdata.gov is HHS's
    own health data portal and answered 200, so it is the recorded feed; the seeds list www.hhs.gov as failed.

